WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.033
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

2
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.700
This time, we're going to win for sure!

3
00:00:25.766 --> 00:00:26.900
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

4
00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:28.766
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

5
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:30.533
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

6
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.966
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

7
00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.433
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

8
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.266
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

9
00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:42.533
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

10
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.966
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

11
00:00:46.033 --> 00:00:49.933
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

12
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.633
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

13
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.900
♪ Pokémon! ♪

14
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.233
Performing with Fiery Charm!

15
00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:10.600
The morning of the Dendemille Town Pokémon Showcase has finally arrived,

16
00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:13.466
but Serena has a slight case of nerves.

17
00:01:13.533 --> 00:01:16.200
Today's the day. Good luck out there, honey.

18
00:01:16.266 --> 00:01:20.400
Thanks! Braixen and Pancham are fired up. Make sure you watch us, OK?

19
00:01:20.466 --> 00:01:21.666
- Braix!
- Pancham!

20
00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:22.733
Right.

21
00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:24.200
- Look at this!
- Huh?

22
00:01:24.266 --> 00:01:28.166
Ta-da! This is the pretty dress I'm going to wear!

23
00:01:28.233 --> 00:01:30.966
Isn't that just a little too flashy?

24
00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:33.700
If that's what my mom thinks, it's perfect!

25
00:01:33.766 --> 00:01:35.166
-Oh, Serena.

26
00:01:35.233 --> 00:01:39.066
That's not all. This dress was designed by none other than Valerie!

27
00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:42.000
Well, that's a tremendous help!

28
00:01:42.066 --> 00:01:45.000
Now, dear, be sure you give it all you've got.

29
00:01:45.066 --> 00:01:47.300
- Be one with your Pokémon!
- Mm-hm. Yeah!

30
00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:48.833
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

31
00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:52.966
Look at all these people!

32
00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:57.900
Let's see. Where do I register?

33
00:01:57.966 --> 00:02:03.333
- Serena, is that you?
- Huh? Huh? Miette!

34
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.400
- Long time no see, everyone!
- Yeah, long time!

35
00:02:06.466 --> 00:02:08.766
- So how have you been, Miette?
- Great!

36
00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:12.333
- Hi, Slurpuff! Good to see you!
- Slurpuff!

37
00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.000
- You're a Meowstic, right?
- Meow.

38
00:02:15.066 --> 00:02:17.700
So are you entering the Pokémon Showcase, too?

39
00:02:17.766 --> 00:02:20.000
Of course! How could I not enter?

40
00:02:20.066 --> 00:02:21.733
I'm not surprised. Huh!

41
00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:24.900
- Hm. You cut your hair.
- Yeah, so what?

42
00:02:24.966 --> 00:02:27.666
So why did you do that? Something big happen in your life?

43
00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:31.433
- Huh! What are you talking about? Huh?
- Pika.

44
00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.766
Forget that! I'm all ready to compete in this performance!

45
00:02:35.833 --> 00:02:38.866
And I'm not going to lose like I did with the Poké Puffs!

46
00:02:38.933 --> 00:02:40.166
- Cham.
- Braix.

47
00:02:40.233 --> 00:02:43.166
Well, the same goes for me. Now hear this!

48
00:02:43.233 --> 00:02:45.433
We're going to settle things once and for all.

49
00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.766
And then... Remember, I told you I might have a chat with Ash.

50
00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:52.733
Later! Bye!

51
00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:56.033
- Miette sure seems ready to go.
- Pika!

52
00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.733
- I'm ready to go, too!
- Right! That's the spirit, Serena!

53
00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:03.066
- Ash can be so dense.
- Denne.

54
00:03:03.133 --> 00:03:05.133
Bonnie, what are you talking about?

55
00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.800
- Of course. You're the same.
- Huh?

56
00:03:07.866 --> 00:03:10.900
So, they're entering the Showcase, too.

57
00:03:10.966 --> 00:03:12.633
What difference does it make?

58
00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:15.400
I'm going home with the big win this time for sure.

59
00:03:15.466 --> 00:03:18.400
With all that special training, we should go home with ten wins!

60
00:03:18.466 --> 00:03:19.900
Wobba! Wobba!

61
00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:35.433
Bonjour, all you Kalos region lovers of Pokémon!

62
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.733
Welcome to the Dendemille Pokémon Showcase Rookie Class!

63
00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.233
We're all set to go, so get ready!

64
00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:45.600
I'm honoured to be your guide,

65
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:50.766
because I just adore the roar of the crowd and the smiles on all your faces.

66
00:03:50.833 --> 00:03:53.800
My name's Monsieur Pierre!

67
00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:57.466
Competing today for the ultimate title of Kalos Queen

68
00:03:57.533 --> 00:04:02.800
will be a bevy of beautiful young ladies performing right before your eyes!

69
00:04:02.866 --> 00:04:08.000
And then, the winner will be awarded the coveted Princess Key!

70
00:04:10.933 --> 00:04:13.000
Performers who win three Princess Keys

71
00:04:13.066 --> 00:04:16.766
earn the right to participate in the exciting Master Class!

72
00:04:16.833 --> 00:04:20.366
And it is from the elegant performers competing in the Master Class

73
00:04:20.433 --> 00:04:23.733
that the Kalos Queen will ultimately be chosen!

74
00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:28.500
Alors, will the future Kalos Queen come from among these fair ladies?

75
00:04:28.566 --> 00:04:30.166
You won't be able to look away,

76
00:04:30.233 --> 00:04:33.733
because the spellbinding battle for the Princess Key starts now!

77
00:04:36.933 --> 00:04:41.833
For our Theme Performance, these talented Pokémon performers

78
00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:45.066
will make delicious and beautiful Poké Puff treats

79
00:04:45.133 --> 00:04:46.600
right in front of your eyes!

80
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:50.366
Now, it's time to meet our first group of three performers!

81
00:04:57.033 --> 00:05:01.033
- Look! It's Miette!
- Yay, Miette! You'll be great!

82
00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.833
Our judges, Pokémon Connoisseur Santo,

83
00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:08.000
Poké Puff Pâtissière Gena, and showcase expert Delilah,

84
00:05:08.066 --> 00:05:10.266
will choose the performer and her Pokémon

85
00:05:10.333 --> 00:05:12.533
who will go on to the Freestyle Performance.

86
00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:15.533
Gena's a keeper, no doubt! She'll take care of my big brother!

87
00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:17.766
I told you not to do this a million times!

88
00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:22.366
Alors... It's time to make the Poké Puffs.

89
00:05:22.433 --> 00:05:24.666
Now, if you please!

90
00:05:28.833 --> 00:05:32.700
No one makes Poké Puffs as yummy as I do.

91
00:05:32.766 --> 00:05:36.433
- OK, Slurpuff!
- Slurpuff!

92
00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.833
- Puff. Slurpuff!
- Thanks very much.

93
00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.866
- Slurpuff got to pick the milk?
- Pika?

94
00:05:41.933 --> 00:05:45.266
Slurpuff has an extremely sensitive sense of smell.

95
00:05:45.333 --> 00:05:47.133
I think Miette had Slurpuff choose

96
00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:49.933
to make sure she uses the freshest ingredients she can.

97
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.500
- Pika.
- Hey, that sounds impressive.

98
00:05:51.566 --> 00:05:52.566
It sure does!

99
00:05:57.066 --> 00:05:59.866
Meowstic? It's your turn.

100
00:05:59.933 --> 00:06:03.866
Meowstic!

101
00:06:04.533 --> 00:06:06.900
Awesome!That's how it's done, Meowstic!

102
00:06:06.966 --> 00:06:09.300
It's obvious Miette and her Pokémon

103
00:06:09.366 --> 00:06:11.700
know how to make Poké Puffs in perfect sync!

104
00:06:11.766 --> 00:06:15.700
So, there are only a few minutes left. Time to sprint to the finish!

105
00:06:15.766 --> 00:06:19.033
Huh?

106
00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:22.933
It's all done.

107
00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:28.433
Time's up! Now we come to the judging!

108
00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.166
These Poké Puffs smell so fragrant!

109
00:06:31.233 --> 00:06:33.166
- They're exquisite!
- Fur. Furfrou.

110
00:06:33.233 --> 00:06:36.666
- These are all definitely a work of art.
- Mime! Mime!

111
00:06:36.733 --> 00:06:39.166
Ne, denne-ne!

112
00:06:39.233 --> 00:06:41.833
They look yummy, huh?

113
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.100
- Huh!
- Chespin, Che!

114
00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:44.933
You've got a great sense of smell, too!

115
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.666
- Chespin! Pin! Ches!
- Pikachu!

116
00:06:47.733 --> 00:06:50.933
It appears the judges have made their choice.

117
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:55.933
So let's find out the winner! The performer moving on will be...

118
00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.566
The lovely Miette!

119
00:07:02.633 --> 00:07:05.500
- But of course it's me!
- Way to go, Miette!

120
00:07:08.066 --> 00:07:11.500
That Miette is a true genius at making Poké Puffs.

121
00:07:11.566 --> 00:07:13.133
- Cham.
- Braix, Braixen.

122
00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.333
Right. We can do it, too!

123
00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:20.233
And now it's time for our next group of performers!

124
00:07:24.800 --> 00:07:28.233
Come on, Jessilia! Destroy every one of those losers!

125
00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.800
Make your Poké Puffs, if you please!

126
00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:39.000
So tell me. Did you take care of what we talked about?

127
00:07:39.066 --> 00:07:40.366
Yeah, and how.

128
00:07:40.433 --> 00:07:44.233
I found out what flavours the judges' Pokémon like best, so don't sweat it!

129
00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.233
Mime Junior likes spicy grub, so we'll use a Tamato Berry topping.

130
00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:52.233
Furfrou likes aromatic grub, so we'll use tons of yummy-smellin' stuff.

131
00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:54.866
And Jigglypuff goes ga-ga for sweets!

132
00:07:54.933 --> 00:07:58.700
- Meowth, you're so smart!
- You know? I agree.

133
00:07:58.766 --> 00:08:00.400
Psyduck.

134
00:08:00.466 --> 00:08:02.000
Sneasel!

135
00:08:02.066 --> 00:08:05.000
- Voilà!
- Now we decorate.

136
00:08:05.066 --> 00:08:08.000
- You can leave the artistic part to me!
- Aaah!

137
00:08:08.066 --> 00:08:10.500
-Wobba, wobba...

138
00:08:11.533 --> 00:08:14.200
And finally we come to the judging!

139
00:08:16.266 --> 00:08:19.700
My... This is quite an unusual decoration.

140
00:08:19.766 --> 00:08:22.700
I knew if Jessie did it, she'd mess things up.

141
00:08:22.766 --> 00:08:25.933
Well, the Pokémon certainly seem to adore the flavours.

142
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:30.000
The most important thing about Poké Puffs is that the Pokémon truly love them.

143
00:08:30.066 --> 00:08:34.466
All right, the performer going to the next stage is Jessilia!

144
00:08:40.033 --> 00:08:43.466
Hey, performer Serena, time for your entrance, OK?

145
00:08:43.533 --> 00:08:46.000
- Braixen.
- Cham.

146
00:08:47.533 --> 00:08:49.966
OK. Here goes.

147
00:08:50.033 --> 00:08:53.000
Who's that Pokémon?

148
00:08:57.033 --> 00:08:59.300
It's Plusle and Minun!

149
00:09:04.766 --> 00:09:08.433
Ladies and gentlemen, get ready for our final grouping!

150
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.333
Yippee! Serena's up now!

151
00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.166
- Show 'em how it's done, Serena!
- Pika!

152
00:09:13.233 --> 00:09:16.700
- Relax, Serena, just relax.
- Che! Che!

153
00:09:24.733 --> 00:09:27.566
It's all right. Be confident.

154
00:09:27.633 --> 00:09:31.633
You've practised over and over for this day.

155
00:09:34.833 --> 00:09:37.066
-Huh?

156
00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:39.500
- Mm! Great!
- Huh?

157
00:09:39.566 --> 00:09:41.600
- Pika!
- These are awesome!

158
00:09:41.666 --> 00:09:43.366
- Huh?
- Chespin...

159
00:09:50.366 --> 00:09:52.533
I'll make the greatest Poké Puffs ever.

160
00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.766
For everyone's who's ever supported me!

161
00:09:54.833 --> 00:10:00.266
It's time to make Poké Puffs. Now, if you please!

162
00:10:05.133 --> 00:10:06.700
You're doing great.

163
00:10:06.766 --> 00:10:09.500
The flower nectar is our secret ingredient.

164
00:10:09.566 --> 00:10:14.033
Cham... Pan! Cham!

165
00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:16.533
Ready, Braixen? Braixen!

166
00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:20.833
Serena and her team are displaying some impressive teamwork!

167
00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:24.833
But no one's giving an inch! This is a true top-notch battle!

168
00:10:30.866 --> 00:10:32.066
Time's up!

169
00:10:34.866 --> 00:10:36.900
- Cham! Cham! Pan!
- Whew!

170
00:10:36.966 --> 00:10:40.600
So which performer will move on to the Freestyle Performance?

171
00:10:40.666 --> 00:10:43.633
That brings us to the judging!

172
00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.566
Pancham, cham.

173
00:10:46.633 --> 00:10:48.300
Brai! Braixen!

174
00:10:48.366 --> 00:10:52.300
You're both right. I did everything I could do.

175
00:10:53.533 --> 00:10:55.800
- Whoa! Look at this.
- Mime!

176
00:10:55.866 --> 00:10:58.700
The colours, shapes, and aromas are quite impressive.

177
00:10:58.766 --> 00:11:01.266
Yes, quite. They're truly inviting.

178
00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:04.766
Every Poké Puff clearly demonstrates it was created with love.

179
00:11:06.033 --> 00:11:09.466
Oh my. This is going to be a very difficult choice.

180
00:11:09.533 --> 00:11:12.866
- Please win it.
- Pika.

181
00:11:12.933 --> 00:11:17.366
- Yet the winner is clear, don't you think?
- I would say so.

182
00:11:17.433 --> 00:11:19.333
The judges have made their decision!

183
00:11:21.900 --> 00:11:25.333
The performer moving on to the next stage is...

184
00:11:31.166 --> 00:11:35.266
- Please, please, please...
- Performer...

185
00:11:37.333 --> 00:11:41.266
- Serena! Congratulations!
- Huh?

186
00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:44.766
That's so awesome! Serena's moving on to round two!

187
00:11:44.833 --> 00:11:46.500
- She pulled it off!
- Fletch! Fletch!

188
00:11:46.566 --> 00:11:48.700
Serena's the best!

189
00:11:48.766 --> 00:11:51.133
- Marvellous!
- Aah!

190
00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.766
Serena!

191
00:11:52.833 --> 00:11:57.766
So we've cleared the first hurdle!

192
00:11:57.833 --> 00:12:00.233
- Whoa, I was nervous. Wow!
- Pikachu!

193
00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:02.600
- Chespin! Ches!
- Huh? No! Chespin, stay here!

194
00:12:02.666 --> 00:12:05.300
I'm sure Serena will make you some when it's over.

195
00:12:05.366 --> 00:12:07.966
- I wanna eat some, too.
- Chespin!

196
00:12:08.033 --> 00:12:09.833
- Pika!
- Denne!

197
00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:12.833
She was great.

198
00:12:16.233 --> 00:12:20.266
Thank you for waiting.

199
00:12:20.333 --> 00:12:24.133
Next, it's the Freestyle Performance you've all been waiting for.

200
00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:28.366
Here are the five young ladies who made it past the Theme Performance.

201
00:12:28.433 --> 00:12:32.600
Guaranteed to show you their greatest performances yet.

202
00:12:32.666 --> 00:12:35.966
First, a mysterious beauty, mixed with a touch of danger.

203
00:12:36.033 --> 00:12:41.433
So fasten your seatbelts and prepare for performer Jessilia!

204
00:12:43.500 --> 00:12:44.933
You go, girl!

205
00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.166
Now, Meowth, move it!

206
00:12:49.233 --> 00:12:51.933
Ah! Aaah!

207
00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.633
Wobba!

208
00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:56.300
-Ba!

209
00:12:56.366 --> 00:12:58.900
- Hey, what's going on?
- It's so cool!

210
00:12:58.966 --> 00:13:04.800
- And up! And up! And up!
- Special trainin' paid off!

211
00:13:07.233 --> 00:13:09.100
All right, performer Serena,

212
00:13:09.166 --> 00:13:11.266
- you're the next one up!
- Right!

213
00:13:11.333 --> 00:13:13.500
OK, Meowth, wrap it up!

214
00:13:20.066 --> 00:13:22.466
Voilà!

215
00:13:22.533 --> 00:13:25.400
Yeah!

216
00:13:25.466 --> 00:13:27.300
That was a great performance.

217
00:13:27.366 --> 00:13:29.900
It's not gonna be easy for Serena to beat that.

218
00:13:29.966 --> 00:13:34.466
Now, say hello to our next performer. Her name? Miette!

219
00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:39.400
Hm!

220
00:13:39.466 --> 00:13:41.766
Pure performance perfection.

221
00:13:41.833 --> 00:13:44.400
- The fans obviously have good taste.
- Wobbuffet.

222
00:13:44.466 --> 00:13:46.533
Let's take charge of the stage.

223
00:13:46.600 --> 00:13:48.000
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

224
00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:51.366
- Watch it!
- Huh!

225
00:13:51.433 --> 00:13:52.333
- Braixen!
- Pan!

226
00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:53.666
I'm terribly sorry.

227
00:13:53.733 --> 00:13:55.966
I didn't see you way down there.

228
00:13:56.033 --> 00:13:57.833
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

229
00:13:58.966 --> 00:14:03.266
It's OK, you two. I... I hope you'll forgive me.

230
00:14:03.333 --> 00:14:05.166
- Braixen.
- I'm just fine, really.

231
00:14:05.233 --> 00:14:06.833
I'm not hurt at all.

232
00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.200
Huh? Huh!

233
00:14:09.266 --> 00:14:12.200
My skirt ripped!

234
00:14:12.266 --> 00:14:14.700
- Braix.

235
00:14:14.766 --> 00:14:20.366
OK, Meowstic! Use Psychic!

236
00:14:20.433 --> 00:14:23.733
Slurpuff, use Cotton Spore!

237
00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:28.566
Slurpuff! Slurp, Slurpuff!

238
00:14:28.633 --> 00:14:32.800
- Miette's pretty cool, too.
- She's really displaying great teamwork.

239
00:14:32.866 --> 00:14:36.066
Well, don't forget Serena's teamwork is great, too!

240
00:14:36.133 --> 00:14:39.566
You bet it is. After all the hard work she's put in.

241
00:14:40.733 --> 00:14:42.933
- Braixen!
- Pancha-cham.

242
00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.900
Not again. It's just like last time.

243
00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:59.566
I've got it.

244
00:14:59.633 --> 00:15:02.033
Ash never gives up.

245
00:15:02.100 --> 00:15:05.533
If he can do it, I can do it, too!

246
00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:09.300
And now... Done!

247
00:15:13.633 --> 00:15:15.733
Well, how was that?

248
00:15:23.966 --> 00:15:27.400
And now the time has come for our very last performer.

249
00:15:27.466 --> 00:15:30.633
- Performer Serena? You're up next!
- I'm sorry!

250
00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.000
Now let's give her a big round of applause!

251
00:15:33.066 --> 00:15:34.633
- Cham, cham, cham.
- We made it in time!

252
00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:39.866
It's performer Serena! Give her a hand!

253
00:15:39.933 --> 00:15:41.366
Serena!

254
00:15:41.433 --> 00:15:45.100
-Aaah!

255
00:15:48.133 --> 00:15:52.566
- Wait. Did she change her outfit?
- I wonder why.

256
00:15:52.633 --> 00:15:54.933
Pancham, come here!

257
00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:57.366
Cham! Pan!

258
00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.633
-Look at that! So pretty!

259
00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:16.266
- All right, Pancham, use Stone Edge!
- Cham, cham!

260
00:16:16.333 --> 00:16:18.766
Cham!

261
00:16:18.833 --> 00:16:24.566
- Braixen, now!
- Braixen, brai!

262
00:16:24.633 --> 00:16:28.133
Cham, cham, cham, cham!

263
00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.766
- Brai!
- Cham!

264
00:16:37.533 --> 00:16:40.933
And that's it!

265
00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.066
- Go, Serena!
- All that practice sure paid off!

266
00:16:44.133 --> 00:16:46.700
- Everything looked amazing!
- Pika!

267
00:16:46.766 --> 00:16:47.933
- Denne!
- Chespin!

268
00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:51.066
What a spectacular sight for our final performance!

269
00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:57.533
Serena did it. Hm.

270
00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:00.666
Alors. It's the moment of truth.

271
00:17:00.733 --> 00:17:06.099
Who will win our exciting Dendemille Town Pokémon Showcase this year?

272
00:17:06.166 --> 00:17:08.366
And who will decide?

273
00:17:08.433 --> 00:17:11.099
Well, it's none other than all of you in the audience.

274
00:17:11.166 --> 00:17:13.666
- The time has finally come.
- Uh-huh.

275
00:17:13.733 --> 00:17:15.099
Serena, please...

276
00:17:15.166 --> 00:17:17.933
Please use your glowsticks to fire off the colour

277
00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:21.500
corresponding to the performer who you think was number one!

278
00:17:21.566 --> 00:17:25.033
- One, two, and on three.
- Jessilia!

279
00:17:25.099 --> 00:17:27.933
-Yay, Serena!

280
00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:46.233
Please, please, please, please, please...

281
00:18:07.333 --> 00:18:11.700
- Huh? Huh! Oh!
- Look at that!

282
00:18:11.766 --> 00:18:13.633
But... It can't be!

283
00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:18.633
The winner of the Dendemille Town Pokémon Showcase has been decided!

284
00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:24.633
And she's... performer Serena!

285
00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:27.300
- Awesome!
- Serena!

286
00:18:27.366 --> 00:18:29.133
Wow, she did it! She did it!

287
00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:35.133
Huh! We won. We actually won the performance!

288
00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.133
Oh, no. Poor Jessie. For that matter, poor me.

289
00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.200
I'm the one who should be Kalos Queen,

290
00:18:40.266 --> 00:18:44.533
so how can so many dumb people get it wrong?

291
00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:47.200
Hm.

292
00:18:49.633 --> 00:18:55.066
And now it's time to present the Princess Key to our victorious performer Serena.

293
00:18:55.133 --> 00:18:58.266
Congratulations on your first Princess Key win.

294
00:18:58.333 --> 00:19:00.166
Klefki! Kelfki, key!

295
00:19:00.233 --> 00:19:04.666
Thank you so much. This is great!

296
00:19:04.733 --> 00:19:09.033
Ta-da! I did it! The Princess Key. Mine!

297
00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:11.166
- Braixen!
- Pancham!

298
00:19:11.233 --> 00:19:13.633
Pikachu! Pika! Pika!

299
00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.600
Congratulations to Serena

300
00:19:15.666 --> 00:19:19.366
for taking her first step towards becoming our Kalos Queen!

301
00:19:19.433 --> 00:19:23.133
So until next time, au revoir!

302
00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:24.133
Yippee!

303
00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:28.633
I've gotta practise even more. This is no time to get lazy.

304
00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:32.166
That's my daughter after all.

305
00:19:33.633 --> 00:19:36.133
Oh, so you ripped your outfit?

306
00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:40.366
Yeah. So that's when I came up with the idea to cut my hem.

307
00:19:40.433 --> 00:19:43.700
Wow, that was really clever. Nice job up there.

308
00:19:43.766 --> 00:19:46.533
I'm sorry I tore the outfit Valerie gave me.

309
00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:49.133
I guess I should tell her how sorry I am.

310
00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:54.333
- You know, it really looked great on you.
- Huh? Oh, thank you, Ash.

311
00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:58.200
- He's telling the truth, you know.
- Huh? It's Miette!

312
00:19:58.266 --> 00:20:02.000
I may have lost today, but I'll win the next time!

313
00:20:02.066 --> 00:20:07.400
- I'll see you then. You just wait.
- It's a deal. You take care.

314
00:20:12.533 --> 00:20:13.633
- Hm.
- Ah!

315
00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:17.333
And I haven't given up on our other competition, either.

316
00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.766
Huh!

317
00:20:18.833 --> 00:20:20.566
See you later, Ash!

318
00:20:20.633 --> 00:20:23.033
- OK, Miette, take care!
- Huh!

319
00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:24.933
- Isn't that sweet?
- Miette!

320
00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.733
- See you!
- Slurpuff!

321
00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.466
Have fun!

322
00:20:28.533 --> 00:20:30.733
- Bye-bye!
- Bye.

323
00:20:30.800 --> 00:20:32.700
Hm.

324
00:20:32.766 --> 00:20:35.233
Hm.

325
00:20:35.966 --> 00:20:40.733
And so, with her first Pokémon Showcase win in Dendemille Town,

326
00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:44.333
Serena's journey as a performer has just begun,

327
00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:48.933
as the journey for all our heroes continues.
